 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oesc_6qi3l0Q7kNvwFjw1ae&_nc_oc=AdkKa1zhYTrhCuAUCb3u0D1Z47ZiBzMJonUJN4moYUHv6Kb5QKALh0XtjDWVBR_ioYo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxEobr79RmwTdfM6yaBCtP4T49JYfbU1EGL4IsCIQqezQ&oe=69B14D39"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9ENbcM1LbjcQ7kNvwHkb0ti&_nc_oc=Adlco4lKtJd2MdwDXUy7E6-m-k1gx2X3UaT1P0HSZR25540AtXjzRxUrk3JqZvlkkHs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyuobiCe9SVPVM0O0xziW6c8zW4kyAmTddj_BNBfjn2gw&oe=69B15CD3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FcqzEvte8WQQ7kNvwFfoY2n&_nc_oc=AdmTEvEcGWaQIVi2_ik0BbvSDY9zw_L0V2dgxBGsCM3qdzyvRj_Bv3YHu02q7_XKrfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwfmb6z1wHh2jQmnwQeBsPnS5cvHUwlLpb03ildwrXkPw&oe=69B1687B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ZqGLAIdcKUQ7kNvwFdWpJO&_nc_oc=AdlbggTlDpekN86sodNhp0LnVAfCM8qdnqFcVMRtYjGqXJabB6DYY8uER6TIBatXLFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwOjtN8jiyQ29vhHw_ArXrru1qxW_6IFUI2qKqGPMOD3A&oe=69B169CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SZxdyNbiCPwQ7kNvwEsOALF&_nc_oc=AdnGDnA2gX9GqNMQQzBTnstAOC3awLeBRZASi2qbtN68p8NR8To8gjyyvnqCSXn2H6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfytH1hAkUabn8cYtoQ4EDQ_QbU9MHXoTXGnMmBLKifXIA&oe=69B152FE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp